<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edges down to 1.8440 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edges down to 1.8440 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged down to 1.8440 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.8390 at the previous session.</p>
<p>					  April 23	   April 22</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar		1.8440	     1.8390</p>
<p> Volume traded			$4.47 mln	  $3.47 mln</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 244 9150</p>
</text>
